CHECKSUM.sha256 -- SHA-256 of every tracked file in this repository.
Generated : 2026-09-29; regenerated 2026-10-01/02 after the N=800 result, the
            certificate status sections, the clone-portable gates and the
            REPO_STRUCTURE postscript for the new file set landed
            (OMEGA_CORE_CERTIFICATE.md 6.1/6.6, PROVENANCE.txt 6.8/6.9).
            The manifest excludes itself by construction.
Paths are REPOSITORY-RELATIVE and use forward slashes. The previous
version of this file recorded absolute Windows paths (C:\Users\...),
which leaked a local username into a public repository; that is fixed
here. File contents are unchanged by that edit.
The previous version was also UTF-16 encoded (PowerShell Out-File default),
which is why git has always reported this file as "Bin ..." in --stat: a
UTF-16 byte stream puts a NUL in every other byte and git then treats the
diff as binary. That occurred in commits de68a32 and 8ec0745, before this
rewrite. This version is UTF-8 / LF / pure ASCII, so from the next change
onward the manifest will diff as text.
